	(text "- 10uF ceramic cap for the package.\n- 100nF ceramic between pins 18-19, 31-32, 47-48 and 63-64.\n- Vbat on pin 1 is connected to VDD with a 100nF decoupling cap.\n- VDDA is connected to VDD through a ferrite bead.\n- VDDA is decoupled with a 1uF and a 100nF cap between pins 12-13.\n- GNDA is directly connected to the GND ground plane."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.326 71.628 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
